# Supabase Configuration
# 
# Get these values from: https://supabase.com/dashboard > Settings > API
#
# 1. SUPABASE_URL: Your project's REST API URL
#    Format: https://YOUR-PROJECT-ID.supabase.co/rest/v1
#
# 2. SUPABASE_ANON_KEY: Your project's anon/public key
#    Format: eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
#
# IMPORTANT: These values now live in public/metadata.js (window.WEDDING_CONFIG.backend).
#            This .env.example file is documentation only - the site is 100% static
#            and reads public/metadata.js directly. Edit that file, not this one.

SUPABASE_URL=https://adnooupemxlhgydtvoeo.supabase.co/rest/v1
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZSIsInJlZiI6ImFkbm9vdXBlbXhsaGd5ZHR2b2VvIiwicm9sZSI6ImFub24iLCJpYXQiOjE3Njg3NTI4NTgsImV4cCI6MjA4NDMyODg1OH0.O5GUKGW3TVDGbcVvFUJZ08F_BbG9fhf5VlgIyBApjLU
